        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/djwewasson/{size}/2402_2.png",
        "created_at": "2016-02-14T16:50:59.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I brought Freedom 6 bunker along to take care of any pesky ongoings. Also used GI Legacy to give Fixer an extra power use and health, same damage as Young Legacy but with a little healing.</p>\n<p>Went with The Block for the environment and got lucky with the Warden coming out on the second turn then nothing but inmates.</p>\n<p>Remember, everything is always according to plan, no one can prove otherwise.</p>",
